OL,3,GNEWSAPolice commissioner issues appeal
OL,4,Aover grooming gangs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police and crime commissioner (PCC)
OL,7,Fhas urged anyone with information about
OL,8,Fgrooming gangs to come forward after 33
OL,9,Fpeople were arrested as part of an
OL,10,Finvestigation into suspected child
OL,11,Fexploitation in Southampton.
OL,13,FHampshire Police confirmed the arrests
OL,14,Fon Friday and said two men had been
OL,15,Fcharged in connection with the
OL,16,Finvestigation.
OL,18,FThe force said it also had seized more
OL,19,Fthan 80 mobile phones as officers
OL,20,Fgathered evidence and identified
OL,21,Fsuspects.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
